    "specific_caveats": [
      "One explicitly funded Castle-start setup with five workers and1000F/2000W/140G; ordinary paid support infrastructure and escorts are completed before the300-second measurement.",
      "All finite gold is unavailable. No later grants or Sacred income. Ordinary food/wood gathering remains enabled.",
      "Full existing AI decision path runs at Medium1.5s cadence; production, builder and caravan movement advance continuously at60Hz. Combat movement is excluded.",
      "Every positive gold ledger entry matches completed caravan delivery; exact paid Siege150W/100G transaction is additionally covered by the compact/Easy fixtures."
