  "diagnostic_history": [
    "Initial human compact fixture assumed four starting workers and old interface/labor details. Root owns its correction and final verification.",
    "Compact Siege fixtures used17/13-second worker/Warrior advances and overfilled the Easy20-pop roster. Test-only877abd4 derives real queue duration, paid roster and the actual3-pop Siege slot; both corrected cases pass.",
    "Initial d614dc8 run was stopped after its240.18-second persisted sample to fix a code-review finding: a gold-unfunded trade plan could withhold military wood. Final runs use the guard in300baaf. No natural outcome is claimed for that superseded run.",
    "Preliminary selected-decision sustained fixture passed14checks, but was strengthened to the full AI decision path and normal cadence; final acceptance is the15-check fixture."
  ],
  "findings": [
    "Neither ordinary simulation purchased trade because banked gold remained above the demand threshold; the policy did not waste scarce wood to satisfy an adoption metric.",
    "The controlled depleted-gold fixture demonstrates sustained autonomous paid trading and a useful paid Siege purchase from trade income, beyond a single payout.",
    "Gold-surplus labor moves back to food/wood. Finite gold may remain unused when current demand and Sacred income make more harvesting unnecessary.",
    "Pacing remains a caveat: this new Medium sample is unfinished at16m40s, and the Hard first Sacred conclusion occurs later than the previous witness. No broad-average target claim follows from these runs.",
    "Between the 20-minute sample and the 25-minute endpoint, paid army completions rose from 39 to 52 and from 51 to 70. Low wood banks did not produce a complete military-production stall during this observed interval.",
    "At 25 minutes, finite food and wood were 91% and 89.41% exhausted, respectively. Gold was only 45.925% exhausted; the AI retained unused finite gold instead of mining it into an already ample bank."
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "Food_deposited_with_farm_job means a deposit while the worker currently had a Farm job; it is not exact per-cargo harvest-origin attribution.",
    "Whole-map finite-resource totals are observer-only audit data; the AI uses current-visible sources and threats.",
    "The controlled fixture proves demand-triggered functionality, not adoption frequency in ordinary matches.",
    "No economic prices or finite stock budgets were tuned, and no additional natural-seed searches were run."
  ],
